<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-BOURSE CLOSES ABOVE 300 POINTS FOR FIRST TIME.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-BOURSE CLOSES ABOVE 300 POINTS FOR FIRST TIME.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn stock exchange index set another high on Wednesday as it rose 1.53 percent to close above 300 points for the first time at 302.29, the stock exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In a statement with final trading data, the bourse said the total trade on the bourse was 111.5 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
